1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:01,850
We are Team MONICA.

2
00:00:01,950 --> 00:00:06,050
Our challenge: keeping astronauts healthy on the long journey to Mars.

3
00:00:06,250 --> 00:00:10,050
Meet MONICA, a mission health console for long-duration crews.

4
00:00:10,250 --> 00:00:12,500
Crew members log quick health check-ins.

5
00:00:12,650 --> 00:00:15,250
Each reading is compared with their own baseline.

6
00:00:15,400 --> 00:00:18,150
Transparent rules flag what needs attention.

7
00:00:18,300 --> 00:00:21,850
And real NASA rover data adds radiation context.

8
00:00:22,200 --> 00:00:27,400
Our vision: crews who can manage their own health, even when Earth is twenty minutes away.
